  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2fabfc503d1abde4ab2527103056f87a, type: 3}
  m_Name: LilliaDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  lines:
  - "Ng\u01B0\u01A1i kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i d\xE2n l\xE0ng \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y."
  - "\xC1nh m\u1EAFt c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i g\u1EA7n nh\u01B0 \u0111\xE3 m\u1EA5t
    \u0111i t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3."
  - "Eiden \u0111\xE3 g\u1EEDi ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111\u1EBFn \u0111\xE2y sao?"
  - "L\xE3o gi\xE0 \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng c\xF2n tin
    v\xE0o L\u1EDDi Ti\xEAn Tri \u0111\xF3."
  - "N\u1EBFu th\u1EBF ta s\u1EBD gi\xFAp ng\u01B0\u01A1i, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0
    ni\u1EC1m tin hay mu\u1ED1n c\u1EE9u th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi."
  - "Ta mu\u1ED1n bi\u1EBFt li\u1EC7u th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi n\xE0y c\xF3 c\xF2n \u0111\xE1ng
    \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\u1EE9u kh\xF4ng."
